				<wikidot:authorName>MrCobalt</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1361966</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Well, he is capable of time-space distortion, so that might account for his ability to be in two places at once, too.</p> <p>Then again, an endless army of identical G-men all serving the same ambiguous &quot;employer&quot; would be creepy as heck.</p> 
				 	]]>
